        "original_id": "252c9679-dfab-5b0c-b080-5a1c1607c519",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nellee Hooper, Baz Luhrmann, Björk, Marius De Vries, Madonna\n- Works: Red Curtain Trilogy, Strictly Ballroom, Romeo + Juliet, Moulin Rouge!, Bedtime Story\n- Roles: producer, remixer, composer, film director, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Baz Luhrmann was born on 17 September 1962 and is an Australian film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Nellee Hooper was born on 15 March 1963 and is a British producer, remixer, and composer.\n- Nellee Hooper became known for work with many major recording artists beginning in the late 1980s.\n- Baz Luhrmann is best known for the Red Curtain Trilogy.\n- The Red Curtain Trilogy comprises Strictly Ballroom (1992), Romeo + Juliet (1996), and Moulin Rouge!.\n- The song \"Bedtime Story\" was written by Björk, Nellee Hooper, and Marius De Vries.\n- \"Bedtime Story\" was the only time Björk wrote a song for a Madonna album.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
